      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T08:49:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is cellular special? And why is it guaranteed that if a new network shows up with a different interface but the same IP address, that the network is the same?\n\nJust because the IP address is the same doesn\u0027t mean the sockets will continue to work. For example, it could be the same IP address on a different carrier...",
      "range": {
