      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T08:49:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should be easy to do this using InetAddress#isLinkLocalAddress and Inet6Address#getScopeId. On Linux, the scope ID is the interface index.\n\nRemember to check that the address is an Inet6Address before doing this. isLinkLocalAddress will return true for addresses in 169.254.0.0/16, but these are not scoped addresses and we don\u0027t need to check the interface ID before closing them.",
      "parentUuid": "d7291b57_618a3213",
